{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"hequan-e-o133","title":"权将征珠崖夷州琮谏不听","accounts":[{"id":"hequan-a-fdca3d1a1c31dbcd70e2","label":"正文","text":"权将征珠崖夷州琮谏不听","evidence":["hequan-q-01c6472f738299d3e330"]}],"participants":[{"person":"sun-quan","role":"将围珠崖及夷州、皆先问琮、不听、军行经岁士众疾疫死者十有八九、深悔之","evidence":["hequan-q-01c6472f738299d3e330"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0005","role":"谏殊方异域隔绝障海水土气毒、兵入民出必生疾病、猥亏江岸之兵以冀万一之利愚臣不安","evidence":["hequan-q-01c6472f738299d3e330"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["hequan-q-01c6472f738299d3e330"]},"ordering_evidence":"hequan-q-01c6472f738299d3e330","source_order":[60,146,0],"order":10577}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0005","name":"全琮","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"hequan-q-01c6472f738299d3e330","section":"chapter-060","block":"b-9f11b802fd19df46d8f3","layer":"original","quote":"初，权将围珠崖及夷州，皆先问琮。琮曰：“以圣朝之威，何向而不克？然殊方异域〖2〗，隔绝障海，水土气毒〖3〗，自古有之。兵入民出，必生疾病，转相污染；往者惧不能反，所获何可多致？猥亏江岸之兵〖4〗，以冀万一之利〖5〗：愚臣犹所不安。”权不听。军行经岁〖6〗，士众疾疫死者十有八九。权深悔之","section_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":145,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":143,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
